<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces are expanding border patrols and issuing warning shots after Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre and artillery struck villages in Tak and Mae Sot, while the Thai foreign minister has contacted Myanmar officials over border fighting that injured Thai nationals. A 15‑year-old Thai golfer was killed and a caddy injured by lightning at a tournament in Chachoengsao. The Thai minister has publicly challenged China’s travel-scam alert targeting Thailand. Residents near the Cambodian border checkpoint remain unable to return to their homes. Cross-border QR payment services are being rolled out in Bangkok, and there were 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNV1FBbGx1YlRRcl9hWDBpX0JabzFyT0tYMDJNUl9Wd2dmZW1IR1VWanVRZUtuYlRfZXVDeU9SLXpQSkM0SVFmY3NONmNLZEdnSEFiWTZ0eGZueWRhYkthY0JKaEtTQVlKenh6TG9hQmRFaV9HVHVaWVRYbUlheGRfTERaOGpNUmxhTHJINDdRMmJReG9tdndDT28xbDFTNnk2NXl0N3lkUjgxdXdiY2Y0VTU2TGd6UTlCUXNVQ3BB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Asia News Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNSDlZTFRFSjZoeGctdlE4cm91b0RFbUFKSkUxeVdXVFg3RVpDYXd3ekprMW5SbmRyYjI2NzFmTGprNnlHalhpUlY2RzEyejBDMVJXXzJKZEZvc3F0ZjBWbzhDeUZ0X1k5V19JTjNZQUNhdS1KMVFudDNhQl9oa0lvV1plajhLSk1vNzJxcnY4TU5YaENxcHNFbG5qY2hFOEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPaUNVZUtWQzFoS0NCZ0JtSjZyS1NxVEppb0o5Z0JUMEdtUmNfZDlrQWtELUNkYlZtaXVOZm9fRUxBUkJ0dTIwQ1dMcUFielNhcUd0cDBpV1lrMHN5LXFZcFFYOXpta21mcVlWU1VXbDZuMG9nV1NXS3RDMGtScjRSdEkwdDhadGdzMW9lTDBub3JCSm01OWh6X0ZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxONmJQT043Z0tiOFR1dTlIOGVTb2NOQ1lhM1lZcWc5TEszdXl1QkFIY3B6RlU2TG1qRnhocUNoRmtlX1VJS0QyNHhhdGdNNy16b3JRSVdpR1IyeUF1Q2